# CAES Aerotermia Platform - Dual-Interface Edition

## Project Context
Building a **B2B SaaS marketplace** for CAES energy certificate automation.
- **Maker:** Installers (field workers, mobile-first)
- **Checker:** Intermediaries/Admin (desktop, control center)
- **Goal:** Automate 2-3 hours of compliance work → 15 minutes

## Code Architecture
- **Language:** TypeScript (strict mode)
- **Framework:** Next.js 15 App Router
- **UI:** Shadcn/UI + Tailwind CSS
- **Database:** Supabase (PostgreSQL + RLS)
- **Format:** 2-space indentation, semicolons, double quotes

## Dual-Interface Design Principles

### Installer Interface (Mobile-First)
- **Primary Device:** Smartphone (iOS/Android via responsive web)
- **UX Philosophy:** One decision at a time (Wizard pattern)
- **Visual Style:** Large buttons (44px min), full-width cards, touch-friendly
- **Interaction:** Snappy, forgiving (can go back/edit)
- **Theme:** Dark mode, emerald green for CTAs

### Admin Interface (Desktop-First)
- **Primary Device:** Desktop/Laptop
- **UX Philosophy:** Dense information, power-user controls
- **Visual Style:** Tables, split-screens, keyboard shortcuts (Cmd+K search)
- **Interaction:** Fast batch actions, real-time feedback
- **Theme:** Dark mode (like Linear.app), subtle grey borders

## Authentication & Authorization
- **Auth Method:** Supabase Auth (email + password)
- **Roles:** installer | admin
- **Role Detection:** Read from `profiles.role` after login
- **Routing:** Middleware redirects to `/installer/*` or `/admin/*` based on role
- **Sessions:** Use Supabase Auth session tokens (no JWT manipulation)

## RLS (Row-Level Security) - CRITICAL
### Installers
- Can read/update ONLY their own projects
- Cannot see other installers' data
- Cannot access admin routes

### Admins
- Can read ALL projects from ALL installers
- Can update any project (for validation)
- Can create/manage other admins (future)

## Data Model (Key Tables)
- `profiles`: user_id, role (installer|admin), company_name, nif
- `projects`: installer_id, status (draft|submitted|approved|rejected), energy calculations, margins
- `project_documents`: Uploaded files + AI extractions
- `audit_log`: Every admin action (for compliance)

## Energy Calculations (Non-Negotiable)
**Formula:**
Savings_kWh = Old_Consumption - New_Consumption
Savings_EUR = Savings_kWh × 0.086
Installer_EUR = Savings_EUR × (Installer_Percent / 100)
Admin_EUR = Savings_EUR - Installer_EUR

**Validation:**
- If Savings < 20% of Old: Flag for review (BOE requirement)
- If Installer_Percent > 30%: Error (legal cap)
- If both pass: Eligible for certificate generation

## Workflow States
### Project Status
- **draft**: Installer is filling the wizard (can edit freely)
- **submitted**: Installer hit "Submit for Review" (read-only for installer)
- **in_review**: Admin is reviewing (only admin can edit)
- **approved**: Admin clicked "Approve & Generate" (read-only for both)
- **rejected**: Admin sent back to installer (with notes)

## PDF Generation (Delayed Until Approval)
- **CRITICAL:** Do NOT generate PDFs until admin clicks "Approve"
- **Why:** Ensures no illegal documents are created
- **When:** Generate all 4 PDFs on approval (background job or async)
- **Storage:** Save to Supabase Storage, email URLs to installer + client

## AI/Claude Integration
- **Extraction:** Use Claude Vision to read invoices/heater labels
- **System Prompt:** See `docs/PROMPTS.md` for exact wording
- **Fallback:** If Claude can't extract, let user fill manually (graceful)
- **Validation:** Admin reviews + can override extraction results

## Design System
- **Colors:** 
  - Installer: Emerald-500 (primary), slate-950 (bg), slate-400 (text secondary)
  - Admin: Same (but denser layout)
- **Buttons:** Shadcn/UI variants (primary, secondary, outline)
- **Typography:** Geist Sans, 14px base, scale 1.25 ratio
- **Animations:** Framer Motion (no bounce, spring ease), confetti on success

## Error Handling
- **Form Validation:** Zod schemas (client + server-side)
- **API Errors:** Return `{ error, message, code }` JSON
- **User Feedback:** Toast notifications (not popups)
- **Logging:** Console in dev, Sentry in prod

## Testing
- Unit tests: Energy calculations, margin splitting (Jest)
- E2E tests: Full wizard flow, admin approval (Playwright)
- Manual: Test on iPhone 13 (375px) + Desktop (1920px)

## Deployment
- **Hosting:** Vercel (auto-deploy from GitHub)
- **Database:** Supabase cloud project
- **Environment:** Use Vercel ENV dashboard (never commit secrets)

## Red Flags
- ❌ Hard-coding installer/admin role (always check DB)
- ❌ Generating PDFs before admin approval
- ❌ Skipping RLS policies (security hole)
- ❌ Not sanitizing uploaded files
- ❌ Displaying financial calculations without validation
- ❌ Using localStorage for sensitive data

## Documentation
- **Why comments:** Link to regulatory requirements or business logic files
- **API routes:** Document with JSDoc (params, response, RLS checks)
- **Complex math:** Comment every formula step

## Git Convention
- Commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `chore:`
- Branches: `feature/installer-wizard`, `fix/rls-margin-calc`, etc.
- PRs: Link to GitHub issues, describe why (not what)
